---
import CorePageTitle from '../core/CorePageTitle.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const workflow = [['Site inspection','Review the property condition, access, dimensions and affected services.'],['Scope planning','Translate the requested outcome into work items, materials and exclusions.'],['Trade coordination','Sequence the agreed renovation, electrical, plumbing, aircond or finishing work.'],['Customer communication','Share practical next steps and confirm changes before additional work proceeds.']];
---
<div class="held-page p3-restored-page">
  <CorePageTitle title="Our Team" description="How RK Reno Solution handles inspection, scope planning, trade coordination and customer communication." />
  <section class="core-section"><div class="exact-wrap p3-restored-hero"><div><p class="core-kicker">HOW THE TEAM WORKS</p><h2>A Property-Service Workflow Without Fictional Profiles</h2><p>The restored WordPress template contained names, portraits and roles that are not verified as RK Reno personnel. They are excluded rather than presented as real employees.</p><p>RK Reno Solution coordinates enquiries around the actual site and the trades required for the agreed work.</p></div><img src={`${base}/assets/media/Construction-workers-discussing-renovation-plans-092133b6.jpg`} alt="Property work requirements being discussed on site" width="1200" height="800" /></div></section>
  <section class="core-section p3-restored-tint"><div class="exact-wrap"><p class="core-kicker">WORKING TOGETHER</p><h2>Inspection, Planning and Coordination</h2><div class="p3-stage-grid">{workflow.map(([title,text],index) => <article><strong>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</strong><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
  <section class="core-section"><div class="exact-wrap p3-restored-split"><img src={`${base}/assets/media/Renovation-planning-and-project-drawings-1-ea76b170.jpg`} alt="Drawings and property information used to coordinate work" width="800" height="500" loading="lazy" /><div><h2>Prepare for the First Discussion</h2><ul><li>Property address and type</li><li>Photos, video and approximate measurements</li><li>Required work and intended finish</li><li>Access rules and preferred timing</li></ul><div class="core-button-row"><a class="core-button core-button-orange" href="https://wa.me/601111334496">Contact the Team</a><a class="core-button core-button-outline" href={`${base}/contact-us/`}>Contact Details</a><a href={`${base}/about-us/`}>About RK Reno</a></div></div></div></section>
</div>
